# PCRE2_ALT_EXTENDED_CLASS turns ordinary [...] classes into the UTS#18
# extended form.  ChangeLog 10.45 item 41; pcre2pattern.3, "UTS#18 EXTENDED
# CHARACTER CLASSES".

# || union, && intersection, -- subtraction, ~~ symmetric difference.
/^[\w&&[^\d]]+$/alt_extended_class
    hedge
 0: hedge
    hedge7
No match

/^[[aeiou]||\d]+$/alt_extended_class
